  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="475bff95-fe1d-5522-94bf-5afa56224194" activityNameId="a931f6b5-4a17-5189-bfbd-7278e1310b60" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Packaging, corrugated board, mixed fibre, single wall, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Packaging, corrugated board, mixed fibre, single wall, at plant
This is an example for the production of boxes out of corrugated board. The user can establish himself further boxes based on the information in this step.;
UUID: 4df85d33-beb5-34f3-8e21-2af32c6ed093
This module includes the production of boxes out of corrugated board. It contains the steps of cutting, folding and printing. Besides the input of corrugated board, inks and glues are considered as well as the electricity consumption.
Location: Estimation based on average data from European producers, collecte from FEFCO
Technology: Average of present used technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: In FEFCO only a combined board and box production is show. For this study this has been split into two different datasets.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4df85d33-beb5-34f3-8e21-2af32c6ed093.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
